<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net sellers of Japan stocks via 5 firms.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of Japan stocks via 5 firms.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through five foreign securities houses before the start of stock trading on Monday showed a net selling stance of 1.4 million shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investor buy orders totalled 4.3 million shares while sell orders amounted to 5.7 million shares.</p>
</text>
